  "prompt": "Which 2 stores sold the most units? Use the sales table. Return two columns, in this order: store_code and units_sold, the total units of that store. Sort by units_sold from highest to lowest; when stores tie on units_sold, sort them by store_code from A to Z. Return only the first 2 rows of that order. The webshop, WEB-01, counts as a store. Order lines with missing units add nothing to the total.",
